ADDITIONAL NOTICE

This repository documents security research performed on the author's own
device for interoperability and personal-use purposes. It is provided for
educational and defensive-research reference only.

No bootloader locks were bypassed, no partitions were written, and no data was
lost during this research. Kernel exploitation research toward persistent root
carries a risk of rendering a device unbootable; use at your own risk.
